{{see also|Florida's 11th congressional district}}
The 11th district consists of a portion of [[Central Florida]], including [[The Villages, Florida|the Villages]] and the western [[Orlando, Florida|Orlando]] suburbs. The incumbent was Republican [[Daniel Webster (Florida politician)|Daniel Webster]], who was re-elected with 63.1% of the vote in 2022.<ref name="HPVT" />

