{{see also|Florida's 13th congressional district}}
The 13th district includes most of [[Pinellas County, Florida|Pinellas County]], including the cities of [[Largo, Florida|Largo]], [[Clearwater, Florida|Clearwater]], and [[Palm Harbor, Florida|Palm Harbor]], as well as a western portion of [[St. Petersburg, Florida|St. Petersburg]]. The incumbent was Republican [[Anna Paulina Luna]], who flipped the district and was elected with 53.1% of the vote in 2022.<ref name="HPVT" />

